<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33075" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring up from childhood, rear up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				750
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέφυσε κἀξέθρεψέ με</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					827
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτεθραμμένοι σκύμνοι λεόντων</span>
			<i>true-bred</i> . ., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1222
			</span></i>; of plants, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐκτρέφον τὴν ῥίζαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.193
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτρέφει ἡ γῆ τὸ σπέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					17.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμοῦ πνεῦμα τραχύτερον ἐκθρέψαντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.357d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>rear up for oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					166
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤνεγκα κἀξέσωσα
			κἀξεθρεψάμην</span>, says the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδαγωγός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				387
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929a
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ σοί τις υἱός ἐστιν ἐκτεθραμμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					796
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγένου τε καὶ ἐξετράφης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					50e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				19.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, of pregnant animals, <i>nourish</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα] μεγάλα ἐντὸς ἐκθρέψωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					91d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Act.
			, <i>bring to birth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κυήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					773a34
				</span></i>
			.</div>
